          "text": "Dear Colleague,\n\n**Re: Epilepsy follow-up**\n\nI reviewed this patient in the epilepsy clinic. They have **focal epilepsy** and continue to experience approximately **two seizures per month**.\n\nThe current seizure burden was discussed, including the importance of adherence to prescribed antiseizure medication and maintaining a seizure diary. Safety advice was reinforced, particularly regarding driving, bathing, swimming, heights, and operating machinery.\n\n**Impression:**  \nFocal epilepsy with ongoing seizures at a frequency of approximately 2 per month.\n\n**Plan:**  \n- Continue epilepsy follow-up.  \n- Record seizure frequency and any possible triggers.  \n- Review antiseizure treatment at the next appointment.  \n- Seek urgent medical attention for a prolonged seizure, repeated seizures without recovery, significant injury, or an event that differs substantially from the usual pattern.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nEpilepsy Clinic",
